WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.573
Assalamu alaikum!

00:00:02.573 --> 00:00:09.382
This short guide shows ISSV students and parents how to join a virtual Sunday class.

00:00:09.382 --> 00:00:13.078
First, make sure you’re signed in with your LearnIslam account,

00:00:13.078 --> 00:00:15.464
not a parent’s or personal Gmail.

00:00:15.464 --> 00:00:21.015
Your LearnIslam account is the one ending in @learnislam.org.

00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:25.675
Next, go to classroom.google.com, or open the Classroom app.

00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:28.741
Your grade has two classes: one for first period,

00:00:28.741 --> 00:00:30.818
and one for second period.

00:00:30.818 --> 00:00:33.058
If you see a “Join” button on them, click it.

00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:38.592
On a virtual Sunday, open the class for the current period,

00:00:38.592 --> 00:00:41.619
and click “Join” next to Meet, at the top left.

00:00:41.619 --> 00:00:44.247
Each period has its own link.

00:00:44.247 --> 00:00:47.612
Before you join, set a school-appropriate virtual background,

00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:50.550
turn your microphone off, and keep your camera on.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.001
Then click “Join now”.

00:00:53.647 --> 00:00:55.311
In class, keep your camera on,

00:00:55.311 --> 00:00:58.257
and stay muted until it’s your turn to speak.

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:01.075
To ask a question, click “Raise hand”.

00:01:01.075 --> 00:01:03.517
There’s no assembly on virtual days.

00:01:03.517 --> 00:01:06.577
Test your connection between 10:00 and 10:15.

00:01:06.577 --> 00:01:11.018
First period starts at 10:15, then the regular schedule.

00:01:11.018 --> 00:01:13.929
If you see “Asking to join”, stay on that screen.

00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:17.728
Your teacher will let you in after checking the class roster.

00:01:17.728 --> 00:01:20.762
Next time, switch to your LearnIslam account first,

00:01:20.762 --> 00:01:25.113
so you get in right away and your name matches the roster.

00:01:25.113 --> 00:01:26.232
You’re all set.

00:01:26.232 --> 00:01:30.231
The written steps are on the Online Classes page of the school website.

00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:31.733
Need help joining?

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:35.853
Email issvsupport@learnislam.org.
